      "id": "get-result-async",
      "name": "GetResultAsync",
      "category": "SceneCullingRenderer",
      "signature": "GetResultAsync(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FSceneInstanceCullingQuery*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FSceneInstanceCullResult*",
      "docs": "Get pointer to the result async, note that this means it may still be in the process of being filled in.\nIt is not safe to access anything in the result until the task has been waited on, either by calling GetResult()\nor GetAsyncTaskHandle().Wait().\nThe data is always allocated on the RDG timeline so is safe to keep a pointer to in e.g., RDG setup tasks and other renderer-lifetime structures."
    },
